# Tender platform

South African government tender intelligence + transparency system. Group Major Tech.

Read `docs/architecture/overview.md` and `docs/BUILD.md` before adding features. Source briefs are in `docs/references/`.

- Monorepo: `apps/*` (not scaffolded yet), `packages/shared`, `docs/`, later `supabase/`.
- Stack: Expo (two apps), Next.js dashboard, Supabase Postgres/Auth/RLS/Storage/Realtime, Node workers for AI and notifications.
- Domain strings live in `@tender/shared`. Do not duplicate role or status literals.
- Do not scaffold apps until the BUILD.md step for that app. Do not invent a custom REST CRUD API.
- After code changes, run `graphify update .` if `graphify-out/` exists.
